# Configurable tolerance with exact polyhedral distance and plane sections.
PROJECT geometric_queries
UNITS mm
TOLERANCE LINEAR 0.001 mm ANGULAR 0.01 deg

MATERIAL alloy ALUMINUM
BODY first_block
MATERIAL alloy
FEATURE stock
TYPE BOX
WIDTH 10 mm
DEPTH 10 mm
HEIGHT 10 mm
END
END

BODY second_block
MATERIAL alloy
FEATURE stock
TYPE BOX
WIDTH 10 mm
DEPTH 10 mm
HEIGHT 10 mm
ORIGIN_X 20 mm
END
END
